---
title: Lower thirds
description: Who is talking, and one line about them. Six — block, line, pill, tag, hand, card — all layers, all staggering their own two lines so the name lands first.
eyebrow: Content creation · Elements
source: src/studio/lower.css
---
<p>A lower third is a name and a line, bottom left, in and out. <code>im-studio-lower</code> is the position; the style is a modifier; the two lines inside arrive one after the other on the layer’s own clock. <code>im-studio-lower-right</code> puts it on the other side; <code>--im-studio-lower-x / -y</code> move it.</p>
